WEBVTT

00:00:03.350 --> 00:00:09.070
This is Hotsauce, an open source office suite for small teams.

00:00:09.070 --> 00:00:11.570
It runs on your own server.

00:00:11.570 --> 00:00:15.630
Every morning starts on Today: your meetings, your tasks,

00:00:15.630 --> 00:00:18.230
and the to-dos your meetings left behind.

00:00:18.783 --> 00:00:23.503
Docs are plain Markdown files, kept in Git.

00:00:23.503 --> 00:00:27.683
Write in a clean editor and link docs with two square brackets.

00:00:27.683 --> 00:00:31.883
Every save is a version, so you can step back through history and see

00:00:31.883 --> 00:00:33.463
who changed what.

00:00:33.950 --> 00:00:39.010
Meetings takes the notes for you, and no bot joins your call.

00:00:39.010 --> 00:00:42.950
After the call, your rough notes and the transcript become clean notes,

00:00:42.950 --> 00:00:45.670
with decisions and action items.

00:00:46.283 --> 00:00:49.223
Ask a question across every past meeting,

00:00:49.223 --> 00:00:54.203
and the answer points back to where it came from.

00:00:54.203 --> 00:00:56.943
Hotsauce also writes a brief for your AI agents,

00:00:56.943 --> 00:01:02.183
and they can read and write everything here, through MCP.

00:01:02.829 --> 00:01:06.409
Action items land in Tasks.

00:01:06.409 --> 00:01:11.029
Type one in plain words, with a date and a project.

00:01:11.029 --> 00:01:16.909
Or just ramble for a few seconds, and Hotsauce sorts it into a clean list.

00:01:18.153 --> 00:01:21.833
Notes hold the small stuff that isn't a doc.

00:01:21.833 --> 00:01:26.073
Color them, pin them, or turn them into checklists.

00:01:29.424 --> 00:01:33.484
Clips replaces the meeting you didn't need.

00:01:33.484 --> 00:01:36.044
Record your screen and talk it through.

00:01:36.044 --> 00:01:39.384
Whoever watches gets a transcript and a summary.

00:01:41.535 --> 00:01:45.375
Dictate turns talking into clean text.

00:01:45.375 --> 00:01:48.755
Hold a key on your Mac and speak into any app,

00:01:48.755 --> 00:01:51.455
or leave a voice note from your phone.

00:01:52.944 --> 00:01:57.924
There's more on the table: whiteboards your team draws on live,

00:01:57.924 --> 00:02:03.364
a people directory, files, forms, booking links, and Briefcast,

00:02:03.364 --> 00:02:06.724
a morning briefing you can play like a podcast.

00:02:07.503 --> 00:02:13.823
Hotsauce is free and open source, and it deploys to Cloudflare in minutes.

00:02:13.823 --> 00:02:16.143
Get it at hotsauce.work.
